WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:10.728
On the PC page, check whether the components that create video and process
sound are ready to use.

00:00:11.792 --> 00:00:20.894
Switch to DGX to inspect the component that turns text into conditions for
generation.

00:00:21.958 --> 00:00:30.944
Here, inspect each component’s task and what it passes to the next stage.

00:00:32.667 --> 00:00:42.941
Open the text-conditioning stage to inspect its component and its
connections to other stages.

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:53.427
Here, check each machine’s role, including the PC’s main video-generation
task.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:01:04.229
This recording only inspects the configuration; it does not start or stop
components or change settings during a run.
